{
  "uid": "fn-hour",
  "title": "hour() — hora do dia (0 a 23, em UTC!)",
  "tags": [
    "promql-lab",
    "08-data-e-hora"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "hour() — hora do dia (0 a 23, em UTC!)",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Analogia:** `hour()` é o **relógio de ponteiro de Greenwich**: diz a hora (0-23) de um timestamp, **sempre em UTC**.\nBrasília = UTC-3: **horário comercial 09h-18h BRT = 12h-21h UTC**. Uso clássico: `alerta and on() hour() >= 12 < 21`.\n\nMétricas: `hour_simulated_clock_timestamp_seconds` (**relógio acelerado**: 1 hora a cada 10s, um dia em 4 min),\n`hour_checkout_errors_ratio` (≈8%, acima do SLO de 5%) e `hour_kube_cronjob_status_last_successful_time` (roda às 03:00 UTC).\n\n📘 Guia completo: `functions/hour/README.md`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "1. Relógio acelerado: hour() de 0 a 23",
      "description": "Dente-de-serra: sobe 1 a cada 10s e volta a 0 à meia-noite (UTC) simulada.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "min",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "hour(hour_simulated_clock_timestamp_seconds)",
          "legendFormat": "hora UTC (acelerada)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "hour(hour_simulated_clock_timestamp_seconds - 3 * 3600)",
          "legendFormat": "hora Brasília (acelerada)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "2. Alerta só em horário comercial (09-18h BRT = 12-21h UTC)",
      "description": "erro > 5% AND hora UTC entre 12 e 20. A linha só aparece em 9 de cada 24 'horas' (90s a cada 240s).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "min",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "hour_checkout_errors_ratio > 0.05 and on() (hour(hour_simulated_clock_timestamp_seconds) >= 12 < 21)",
          "legendFormat": "alerta (horário comercial)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
